nsure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-18467ecb-f872-52de-8c3a-954144e25dbe" :answer/id #uuid "18467ecb-f872-52de-8c3a-954144e25dbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{{s}^{2}+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-66762fbf-e11e-5167-966c-39877463d24c" :question/id #uuid "66762fbf-e11e-5167-966c-39877463d24c" :question/math-academy-id "q-332822" :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=2{x}_{1}(t)+2{e}^{-t} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)={x}_{1}(t)+{x}_{2}(t)+3,\\end{aligned}\\,x(0)=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the initial value problem above. By applying the Laplace transform to both sides of each equation, we get the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{{field-1}}=2{X}_{1}(s)+{{field-2}} \\\\ s{X}_{2}(s)+1={X}_{1}(s)+{X}_{2}(s)+{{field-3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${X}_{1}(s)=L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}$ and ${X}_{2}(s)=L\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}$ are the Laplace transforms of the functions ${x}_{1}(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t),$ respectively." :question/worked-solution "First, we compute the Laplace transforms of both sides of each equation in our system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}L\\{{x}_{1}^{′}(t)\\}=L\\{2{x}_{1}(t)+2{e}^{-t}\\} \\\\ L\\{{x}_{2}^{′}(t)\\}=L\\{{x}_{1}(t)+{x}_{2}(t)+3\\}\\end{aligned}\\,\\,\n$$\n\nUsing the derivative property of the Laplace transform, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}sL\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}-{x}_{1}(0)=2L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}+2L\\{{e}^{-t}\\} \\\\ sL\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}-{x}_{2}(0)=L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}+L\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}+3L\\{1\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the results\n\n$$\nL\\{1\\}=\\frac{1}{s},\\,L\\{{e}^{-t}\\}=\\frac{1}{s+1},\n$$\n\nwe can write our system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}s{X}_{1}(s)=2{X}_{1}(s)+\\frac{2}{s+1} \\\\ s{X}_{2}(s)+1={X}_{1}(s)+{X}_{2}(s)+\\frac{3}{s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${X}_{1}(s)=L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}$ and ${X}_{2}(s)=L\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}$ are the Laplace transforms of the functions ${x}_{1}(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t),$ respectively." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e33e0829-2491-5da0-ad4e-1b61cf04faeb" "answer-field-90d27cda-642e-5d92-9a38-4c8f9dcf83c7" "answer-field-40e0a39d-4679-5747-82c4-6684f78b821e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e33e0829-2491-5da0-ad4e-1b61cf04faeb" :answer-field/id #uuid "e33e0829-2491-5da0-ad4e-1b61cf04faeb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-a52d0672-5ea6-5aa6-aabc-a0f6a404f18b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e66ec9ec-e7e4-5526-a4dc-c8046355a46e" "answer-a52d0672-5ea6-5aa6-aabc-a0f6a404f18b" "answer-90e03dd6-44b1-53e0-8a9b-2f83647308f0" "answer-adfb4c42-f0b8-511b-9c6c-ec27fa3c7eae"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e66ec9ec-e7e4-5526-a4dc-c8046355a46e" :answer/id #uuid "e66ec9ec-e7e4-5526-a4dc-c8046355a46e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{X}_{1}(s)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a52d0672-5ea6-5aa6-aabc-a0f6a404f18b" :answer/id #uuid "a52d0672-5ea6-5aa6-aabc-a0f6a404f18b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s{X}_{1}(s)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-90e03dd6-44b1-53e0-8a9b-2f83647308f0" :answer/id #uuid "90e03dd6-44b1-53e0-8a9b-2f83647308f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s{X}_{1}(s)-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-adfb4c42-f0b8-511b-9c6c-ec27fa3c7eae" :answer/id #uuid "adfb4c42-f0b8-511b-9c6c-ec27fa3c7eae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{X}_{1}(s)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-90d27cda-642e-5d92-9a38-4c8f9dcf83c7" :answer-field/id #uuid "90d27cda-642e-5d92-9a38-4c8f9dcf83c7" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-25c40b1e-0e34-543a-bb17-0ca5b5743396" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6296c2a0-93c4-5a3a-b085-38c9eeadf588" "answer-25c40b1e-0e34-543a-bb17-0ca5b5743396" "answer-15ac0469-96a2-5696-8c0c-fdb42fd2e3fa" "answer-0ee4da